  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alchemy sphere ((poison) package), Nature sphere ((water) package).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you create a fog, you may spend 1 additional spell point to spread an inhaled poison that you have created through the entire area of your fog. Creatures inside the fog must attempt a Fortitude saving throw each round to resist the effects of your poison, using your Nature sphere DC in place of your Alchemy sphere DC. A creature that successfully saves against the fog’s poison is immune to being poisoned by that instance of fog for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc70\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
